#: inc/security.php:1062
msgid "A post or page whose title, address or text reads as casino or betting spam, or that is published from outside the editor, is saved as Pending, never published, and logged below. The guide pages the theme ships are exempt."
msgstr ""

#: inc/security.php:1063
msgid "Answer 410 Gone on the address of removed spam"
msgstr ""

#: inc/security.php:1063
msgid "Search engines drop a 410 address faster than a 404 one. Only addresses of spam moved to the trash from this tab are affected."
msgstr ""

#: inc/security.php:1065
msgid "LQ_SECURITY_LOCK is false in wp-config.php, so the three remote-publishing switches are off whatever they show."
